Package: smolhost
Version: ${version}
Section: net
Priority: optional
Architecture: amd64
Maintainer: replghost <110247003+replghost@users.noreply.github.com>
Installed-Size: ${installed_size}
Depends: libc6 (>= ${glibc_floor}), libgcc-s1, systemd, dbus-user-session
Homepage: https://github.com/replghost/smolhost
Description: experimental shared Polkadot light-client user service
 Independent, unofficial light-client daemon and command-line client, powered
 by smoldot. Provides read-only Polkadot JSON-RPC over a local Unix socket.
 Includes pinned Paseo chain specifications and opt-in systemd user units.
 No services are enabled, started, restarted or stopped by this package.
 Experimental prototype; not security-audited or suitable for production funds.
